<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/10/eng@/~cl_13__para_b> <https://schema.org/text> "by inserting after subsection (2) the following subsections: “(3) The Lembaga may, for the purpose of the registration of contractors, impose such conditions as it thinks fit. (4) The Lembaga may suspend, revoke, reinstate or refuse any registration of any person under this Act. (5) A person aggrieved by the decision of the Lembaga made under subsection (4) may, within thirty days after the date the decision of the Lembaga was communicated to him, appeal to the Minister in writing against the decision and the decision made by the Minister shall be final.”. New section 25a"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/10/eng@> .
