<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/10/eng@/~cl_30> <https://schema.org/text> "Section 40 of the principal Act is amended by substituting for subsection (1) the following subsection: “(1) The Minister may by order published in the Gazette exempt, subject to such conditions as he may deem fit to impose, any person or class of persons from all or any of the provisions of this Act for any good reason which is consistent with the purpose of this Act.”. Amendment of Third Schedule"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/10/eng@> .
