<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/10/eng@/~cl_31> <https://schema.org/text> "The Third Schedule of the principal Act is amended by substituting for the word “subsection 32(2)” the word “subsection 33a(2)”. (Amendment) New Fourth Schedule"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/10/eng@> .
