<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/10/eng@/~cl_32> <https://schema.org/text> "The principal Act is amended by inserting after the Third Schedule the following schedule: “FOURTH SCHEDULE [Subsection 33c(1)] STANDARDS FOR CERTIFICATION OF CONSTRUCTION MATERIAL No. Types of construction material Approved standards by the Lembaga 1. Sanitary wares (ceramic) (a) Wash basin MS 147: 2001 : Specification for Quality of Vitreous China Sanitary Appliances (b) Water closet pan without MS 147:2001 and MS 1522:2007 flushing cistern Specification for Vitreous China Water Closet Pans MS 147:2001, MS 1522:2007 (c) Water closet with flushing and MS 795:2002 cisterns MS 147:2001 (d) Bidets and urinals pedestal MS 147:2001 and MS 795:2002 (e) Flushing cisterns equipped with mechanism MS 147:2001 (f) Flushing cisterns not equipped with mechanism MS 795:2002 (g) Plastic flushing cisterns 2. Ceramic tiles MS ISO 13006:2003 3. Steel frame scaffoldings MS 1462:1999 4. Vitrified clay pipes and fitting MS 1061:Part 2:2008 and pipe joints for drains and sewers No. Types of construction material Approved standards by the Lembaga 5. Cold reduced mild steel wire MS 144:2006 for reinforcement of concrete 6. Steel welded fabric for MS 145:2006 reinforcement of concrete 7. Portland cement (a) White Portland cement MS 888:1991 (b) Ordinary and rapid MS 522:Part 1:2007 hardening Portland cement (c) Sulfate resisting Portland MS 1037:1986 cement (d) Pulverised fuel ash MS 1227:2003 Portland cement (e) Blast furnace Portland MS 1389:1995 cement 8. Hydraulic Cement (a) Pozzolonic pulverised MS 1520:2001 fuel ash cement (b) High slag blast furnace MS 1388:1995 cement (c) Masonry cement MS 794:2010 9. Hot rolled steel bars for MS 146:2006 reinforcement of concrete 10. Prefabricated timber roof truss CIS 5 system 11. Hot rolled non alloy structural MS 1490:2001 steel sections (Amendment) No. Types of construction material Approved standards by the Lembaga 12. Precast concrete piles for MS 1314:Part 1-6:2004 foundation 13. Steel wire ropes for lifts MS ISO 4344:2004 14. Specification for steel frame MS 1462:1999 scaffoldings 15. Iron and steel products (a) Specification for low carbon MS 1092:1987 steel wire rods (b) Specification for high MS 1093:1987 carbon steel wire rods (c) Specification for low carbon MS 1137:2009 steel wires (d) Specification for uncoated MS 1138:Parts 1-4:2007 seven-wire stress-relieved strand for pre-stressed concrete (e) Specification for galvanized MS 1239-1:2009 low carbon steel wire for armoring cables 16. Insulation materials (a) Specification for mineral MS 1020:2010 fibre thermal insulation material 17. Float glass (a) Specification for float MS 1138:Part 1-4:2007 and polished plate float glass No. Types of construction material Approved standards by the 18. MS 1064 : 2001 GUIDE TO MODULAR COORDINATION IN BUILDING (a) Stairs and stairs opening MS 1064:Part 3:2001 (b) Door sets MS 1064:Part 4:2001 (c) Window sets MS 1064:Part 5:2001 (d) Rigid flat sheets MS 1064:Part 6:2001 (e) Tiles MS 1064:Part 7:2001 (f) Masonry, bricks and MS 1064:Part 8:2001 blocks (g) Cabinets MS 1064:Part 9:2001 (h) Reinforced concrete MS 1064:Part 10:2001.”. components Transitional provision"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/10/eng@> .
