<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/10/eng@/~cl_33__subsec_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/10/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/10/eng@/~cl_33__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "During such period mentioned in subsection (1), such construction personnel including construction site supervisor and skilled construction worker shall, as soon as practicable make an application for registration, accreditation or certification, whichever is applicable to them, in accordance with this Act."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/10/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/10/eng@/~cl_33__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/10/eng@/~cl_33> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/10/eng@> .
