<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/10/eng@/~cl_33__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "Any person who immediately before the date of coming into operation of this Act, had been dealing or undertaken to be engaged in dealing with construction materials specified under the Fourth Schedule without the certification of the Lembaga, may continue to do so during the period of six months from the commencement of this Act. (Amendment)"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/10/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/10/eng@/~cl_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/10/eng@> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/10/eng@> .
